{"id":"n24898-2-7","stage":2,"title":"창구 · 窗口","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24898-2-7-1","ko":"어느 창구에서 돈을 바꿀 수 있습니까?","zh":"请问在哪个窗口可以兑换货币？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어느","meaning":"哪，哪个","explanation":"어느：哪，哪个","readings":[{"term":"어느","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62822","senseId":"3","lemma":"어느","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"창구에서","meaning":"窗口","explanation":"창구：窗口；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"창구","audio":"/audio/6a1c772af0321f5108a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24898","senseId":"2","lemma":"창구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돈을","meaning":"钱，金钱，钱币","explanation":"돈：钱，金钱，钱币；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"1","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바꿀","meaning":"换，更换，调换","explanation":"바꾸다：换，更换，调换；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"바꾸다","audio":"/audio/5cc3393b01c955d1c3fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17198","senseId":"1","lemma":"바꾸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있습니까?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；습니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"76e7139b030308e7","term":"어느","zh":"哪，哪个","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3","entryId":"62822","definition":"不管任何人或物。","pronunciation":["어느"]},{"id":"6a1c772af0321f51","term":"창구","zh":"窗口","audio":"/audio/6a1c772af0321f5108a0.mp3","entryId":"24898","definition":"办公室或营业场所等地可以与外部人员接触或交换文件